WEBVTT

00:02.185 --> 00:05.643
Let's see. Sperm meets egg here.

00:05.822 --> 00:11.021
Um, 30 days has September.
All the rest have 31.

00:11.194 --> 00:14.459
Except for Judith, who has 28.

00:15.298 --> 00:17.766
Hey, Alan. Meet Don.

00:18.334 --> 00:20.700
- Hello, Don.
- Hello, Alan.

00:22.172 --> 00:24.766
Don drove me home
and I don't have any money.

00:25.475 --> 00:27.306
Okay. Uh, is Don a cabbie?

00:27.610 --> 00:33.014
No. No. Don is a close personal friend.

00:33.349 --> 00:35.442
Don is a cabbie, he has enough friends...

00:35.618 --> 00:37.677
...and he wants his $80.

00:38.121 --> 00:41.056
- What happened to your money?
- Good question.

00:41.224 --> 00:43.988
You know how easy
Texas Hold'em looks on TV...

00:44.160 --> 00:46.458
...when you can see
the other guys' hole cards?

00:46.896 --> 00:49.194
- Yeah.
- Very different in real life.

00:51.935 --> 00:57.134
Uh, 20, 40, 60, 80.

00:58.308 --> 01:00.003
No tip?

01:00.877 --> 01:02.504
Hold on.

01:03.012 --> 01:06.379
Let me see. Five dollar-

01:06.549 --> 01:10.076
Keep you money, Mr. Trump.
You need it more than I do.

01:12.055 --> 01:13.682
Are we still on for lunch?

01:20.663 --> 01:22.995
I think you offended Don.

01:23.399 --> 01:25.424
He'll get over it. Where's your car?

01:25.869 --> 01:29.828
Don't change the subject.
You owe Don an apology.

01:30.974 --> 01:33.408
- Oh, hey, a calendar.
- Yeah.

01:33.877 --> 01:38.678
- What's "JMC" stand for?
- Nothing.

01:38.848 --> 01:42.614
Oh, come on. John Mellencamp Cougar?

01:43.453 --> 01:44.681
No.

01:44.854 --> 01:48.085
Jumping Methodist Cougar?

01:49.259 --> 01:52.092
- No.
- Then I give up.

01:52.495 --> 01:55.953
Well, if you must know,
it stands for "Judith's menstrual cycle."

02:00.770 --> 02:03.364
- Get out.
- No, look.

02:03.540 --> 02:06.008
This is when Judith and Herb broke up.

02:06.176 --> 02:08.701
And this is the day
that I had sex with her.

02:09.312 --> 02:12.873
Dude, you need a better hobby.

02:14.284 --> 02:17.276
Judith is now five months pregnant.

02:17.453 --> 02:19.318
Oh, yeah, right.

02:19.489 --> 02:22.720
She's probably in that sweet spot
where her boobs are big and cushy...

02:22.892 --> 02:25.258
...but her ass is still normal.

02:25.595 --> 02:29.622
Charlie, it is almost certain
that I am the father of Judith's baby.

02:30.200 --> 02:32.566
Are you still grinding on this?

02:32.735 --> 02:35.101
What if it's a girl?
I always wanted a daughter.

02:35.271 --> 02:38.832
I finally get one
and some other guy gets to be her dad.

02:39.008 --> 02:42.500
I feel like the universe is playing
some horrible practical joke on me.

02:43.012 --> 02:47.608
Wow, I lost $8000 playing poker...

02:47.784 --> 02:50.218
...have no idea where my car is...

02:50.386 --> 02:53.480
...threw up in my mouth three times...

02:53.656 --> 02:56.318
...and I'm still having a better night
than you are.

02:58.027 --> 02:59.654
I don't expect you to understand.

02:59.829 --> 03:01.694
You don't know the joy
of being a parent.

03:01.865 --> 03:05.096
Of watching a part of you
grow and develop...

03:05.268 --> 03:07.998
...blooming into a fully-formed
human being.

03:20.483 --> 03:22.314
Four times.

03:32.595 --> 03:33.721
- Hi.
- Hi.

03:33.897 --> 03:36.161
Jake, your father's here.

03:37.166 --> 03:38.997
- So how you doing?
- Good.

03:39.435 --> 03:41.630
- Over the morning sickness?
- Yes, Alan.

03:41.804 --> 03:45.900
Uh, by my calculations
probably about a week, 10 days ago.

03:46.809 --> 03:48.868
- That sounds right.
- Good, good.

03:49.045 --> 03:51.673
You have a nice break
till the, uh, old hemorrhoids come a-calling.

03:53.049 --> 03:54.710
Jake!

03:56.352 --> 03:59.287
Judith, are we gonna talk about
the elephant in the room?

03:59.722 --> 04:03.658
- What elephant?
- Come on, you, me, the baby?

04:03.826 --> 04:07.284
- We did have unprotected sex when-
- You shut your mouth. We did not.

04:07.664 --> 04:11.156
- Yes, we did.
- Read my lips. We did not have sex.

04:11.334 --> 04:14.326
- Oh, hey, Alan. How goes it?
- Oh, uh, fine, Herb.

04:14.504 --> 04:16.472
- How you doing?
- Proud as a peacock.

04:16.639 --> 04:18.664
- Honey, did you show him the sonogram?
- No.

04:18.841 --> 04:20.308
Oh, you should see her, Alan.

04:20.576 --> 04:22.134
