04:29.819 --> 04:31.047
Well, you can't have mine.

04:32.422 --> 04:33.446
No, no, of course not.

04:33.623 --> 04:36.649
- Hey, wanna see the nursery?
- He doesn't wanna see the nursery.

04:36.826 --> 04:39.192
Sure. You going with mermaids?
Girls love mermaids.

04:39.362 --> 04:41.489
Oh, actually, I was thinking little ponies.

04:41.664 --> 04:43.291
- Little ponies?
- Yeah. Why?

04:43.466 --> 04:47.835
Oh, gosh. Little ponies have little penises.

04:48.004 --> 04:50.472
Really?
I didn't notice that on the stencils.

04:51.074 --> 04:52.541
Let's go take a look.

04:52.709 --> 04:54.233
- I'm ready.
- Oh, uh, I'll be right back.

04:54.410 --> 04:56.173
I'm just gonna go see the baby's room.

04:56.346 --> 05:00.510
- He never wants to see my room.
- That's because your room is a pig sty.

05:00.683 --> 05:02.150
I didn't ask for a reason.

05:09.592 --> 05:13.084
Alan, buddy, I'm getting a little concerned
about your drinking.

05:13.262 --> 05:14.422
I don't have a problem.

05:14.931 --> 05:18.560
Well, I do. You're swilling my good stuff.

05:19.836 --> 05:20.860
Here.

05:22.238 --> 05:23.967
Have some Old Walmart.

05:26.075 --> 05:27.099
