05:28.578 --> 05:29.602
What's this?

05:29.779 --> 05:31.838
Uh, a diary I kept
during Judith's pregnancy.

05:32.215 --> 05:35.116
"Jennifer, Jocelyn, Jasmine, Jolene"?

05:35.284 --> 05:38.947
Some of the names that we picked out
in case Jake had been a girl.

05:39.122 --> 05:41.784
Oh, man.
Can you imagine him as a chick?

05:43.226 --> 05:44.318
Woof.

05:46.396 --> 05:48.557
Yeah, well, that's not how it turned out.

05:48.831 --> 05:49.923
Think about it, though.

05:50.099 --> 05:53.762
Every weekend, me, you
and a big ugly girl with a bad haircut.

05:55.004 --> 05:57.802
- I'm gonna have a daughter, Charlie.
- Okay, okay.

05:57.974 --> 06:00.807
First of all, you don't know it's your kid.

06:00.977 --> 06:04.845
All we know is that when Judith and Herb
broke up, you nailed Judith.

06:05.014 --> 06:07.346
Then when they reconciled,
Herb nailed Judith.

06:07.517 --> 06:10.850
So the only thing we know for sure
is that, despite all outward appearances...

06:11.020 --> 06:12.647
...Judith is a slut.

06:13.322 --> 06:16.621
Hey, I'm aware that technically
either one of us could be the father...

06:16.793 --> 06:19.990
...but I know in my gut
that this is my sweet bastard child.

06:20.496 --> 06:21.656
You don't know squat.

06:22.398 --> 06:24.730
You wanna talk technically?

06:24.901 --> 06:28.462
Technically,
maybe neither one of you is the father.

06:28.638 --> 06:30.765
Oh, dear God, Charlie.
What have you done?

06:32.141 --> 06:35.167
Not me, you fool. Although if I'd known
she was that easy, maybe-

06:35.344 --> 06:36.436
Stop.

06:37.313 --> 06:40.373
I'm saying is there could very well
be some guy in her driveway...

06:40.550 --> 06:43.348
