for baby Juanita.

06:44.053 --> 06:46.988
That's just ridiculous.
Judith won't even eat Mexican food.

06:48.024 --> 06:49.355
Look, look.

06:49.525 --> 06:53.188
Even if you're right, doing anything about it
is just gonna destroy a marriage.

06:53.362 --> 06:56.991
I know. I know. It's just so hard
to ignore my paternal instincts.

06:57.266 --> 07:01.828
Sure, I see those instincts with Jake
and I admire them.

07:02.004 --> 07:04.131
I would've dropped him off
at an orphanage...

07:04.307 --> 07:06.468
