07:06.642 --> 07:09.167
No, you wouldn't.
He was adorable when he was a baby.

07:09.512 --> 07:12.879
Baby? I'm talking about last week.

07:15.084 --> 07:18.315
I walked into his room,
he was trying to bite his toenails.

07:19.789 --> 07:22.781
Let's be honest, that's monkey behavior.

07:23.493 --> 07:24.858
My son is not a monkey.

07:25.027 --> 07:29.361
My point here is forget the baby.
You've already got a kid to raise.

07:29.532 --> 07:30.624
Yeah, I guess.

07:31.000 --> 07:32.331
Hi.

07:40.376 --> 07:41.900
He's not a monkey.

07:45.815 --> 07:48.443
&lt;i>- did a good job
upfront and he had a ton of-&lt;/i>

07:48.618 --> 07:50.745
Whoa, whoa, whoa. What are you doing?

07:50.920 --> 07:54.321
- I don't wanna watch football.
- Nobody cares what you wanna watch.

07:55.191 --> 07:57.159
