07:57.760 --> 08:00.888
Oh, I don't know. Maybe it's because
I bought everything around here.

08:01.330 --> 08:03.594
Oh, right, play the money card.
That's all you got.

08:04.100 --> 08:07.001
That's all I need. Now shut up.

08:08.938 --> 08:10.872
No, you shut up.

08:14.610 --> 08:19.513
