08:23.186 --> 08:24.847
One.

08:25.988 --> 08:27.956
- Two.
- I'm only leaving because I'm bored.

08:30.927 --> 08:33.395
He keeps growing, I'm screwed.

08:34.630 --> 08:37.428
Hey, uh, you wanna hear
what I wrote the night you were born?

08:37.600 --> 08:38.760
Not really.

08:39.402 --> 08:41.893
Oh, come on. Come on, uh, sit down.
You'll like it.

08:44.173 --> 08:47.267
It's kind of a poem, heh. Um...

08:47.443 --> 08:50.776
&lt;i>My son, my son, my only one&lt;/i>

08:50.947 --> 08:53.780
&lt;i>You open my heart like the morning sun&lt;/i>

08:53.950 --> 08:56.885
&lt;i>Your tiny face, your tiny hand&lt;/i>

08:57.053 --> 09:00.318
&lt;i>Never have I felt a love so grand&lt;/i>

09:02.792 --> 09:04.259
Gay.

09:10.533 --> 09:13.024
What do you know about poetry,
