10:01.851 --> 10:03.318
I didn't mean to interrupt.

10:03.486 --> 10:06.046
Yeah, well, you should have thought of that
before you barged in.

10:08.357 --> 10:09.881
Yeah.

10:10.259 --> 10:11.749
The reason I barged in...

10:11.927 --> 10:14.691
