to kick your ass.

10:14.864 --> 10:16.161
I wouldn't really do that.

10:16.332 --> 10:18.698
You couldn't really do that.

10:21.203 --> 10:24.832
Anyway, I was thinking about
ordering a pizza. You interested?

10:25.007 --> 10:26.372
No, thanks.

10:26.542 --> 10:28.703
Maybe you didn't hear me. Pizza.

10:30.112 --> 10:33.570
Dough, sauce, cheese, grease, meat.
I've seen you lick the box.

10:34.016 --> 10:35.745
