11:04.513 --> 11:06.913
When babies grow up a little,
you can have fun with them.

11:07.083 --> 11:11.247
You know, pee in their canteen,
teach them to stutter.

11:11.420 --> 11:13.888
The down side is they're so damaged...

11:14.056 --> 11:17.651
