I'll put a gun in your mouth...

12:40.242 --> 12:42.301
...and paint these walls with your brains.

12:42.645 --> 12:44.943
I think we settled on mermaids.

12:45.548 --> 12:47.311
Cookie for my cookie?

12:47.483 --> 12:48.507
Oh, yum. Thank you.

12:51.587 --> 12:54.488
- Wow, pregnancy's a wild ride, huh?
- Ugh.

12:54.657 --> 12:58.149
One minute she's loving and affectionate
and the next minute she's, well-

12:58.627 --> 13:00.822
Cruel? Vengeful? Castrating?

13:00.996 --> 13:02.725
I was gonna say "moody."

13:02.898 --> 13:04.627
Wait for it.

13:06.535 --> 13:08.901
Of course I wanna go to the party.

13:09.071 --> 13:11.164
Because my stupid uncle won't let me.

13:14.343 --> 13:16.573
I don't know,
because he's old and clueless.

13:17.246 --> 13:20.477
No, I can't sneak out.
I gotta be here to change his adult diapers.

13:20.649 --> 13:23.277
Otherwise, he just sits in his own filth.

13:23.986 --> 13:26.386
I know, it's really gross.

13:27.323 --> 13:30.224
- Hi there.
- Gotta go.

13:31.694 --> 13:34.094
You're not supposed to listen
to my private conversations.

13:34.263 --> 13:36.754
You're not supposed to tell people
I crap my pants.

13:37.666 --> 13:38.724
Okay, whatever.

13:43.839 --> 13:47.138
