about your social life.

13:50.412 --> 13:51.436
Just leave me alone.

13:51.881 --> 13:54.748
You know that's not gonna happen.
Come on, you can trust me.

13:54.917 --> 13:56.942
You told me
"Never trust a guy who says 'Trust me. "'

13:57.119 --> 13:59.087
