embarrassing about myself first?

14:13.168 --> 14:14.533
Like what?

14:14.703 --> 14:16.671
Well, let's see.

14:16.839 --> 14:18.136
All right.

14:19.074 --> 14:20.974
About 15 years ago, I was in Bangkok.

14:24.280 --> 14:26.305
- What?
- Bangkok.

14:28.651 --> 14:31.779
- It's a real place, you nimrod.
- Still funny, though.

14:33.455 --> 14:37.448
Anyway, I was in this bar
and I met this beautiful woman...

14:37.626 --> 14:41.687
