and I didn't notice the Adam's apple.

14:44.366 --> 14:45.663
But later that night-

14:48.003 --> 14:50.471
Well, believe me,
I was really embarrassed.

14:51.240 --> 14:53.470
Girls don't have Adam's apples.

14:55.377 --> 14:57.641
Oh, dude. You are such a 'mo.

14:59.982 --> 15:03.782
- No, no, no. We just kissed.
- Aw, that's even worse.

15:05.754 --> 15:09.155
- All right. I shared, now you share.
- You didn't have to share that.

15:11.160 --> 15:13.788
A fart in the lunch line
would've made your point.

15:14.897 --> 15:17.491
I get it. I'm sorry. Now talk.

15:19.134 --> 15:20.601
Okay.

15:20.769 --> 15:24.170
Well, there's this girl I kind of like
and she's gonna be at the party tonight.

15:24.340 --> 15:25.364
Uh-huh.

15:25.541 --> 15:28.840
