to hook up with me.

15:29.511 --> 15:30.910
And you're nervous.

15:31.080 --> 15:33.742
Well, she's gone out with a ninth grader
and she's done stuff.

15:34.483 --> 15:36.144
Okay, I get it.

15:36.318 --> 15:39.219
You've got yourself an experienced
older woman who knows more.

15:39.388 --> 15:40.719
Everybody knows more than me.

15:40.889 --> 15:42.754
You should hear the things
my friends have done.

15:43.158 --> 15:46.525
- Oh, please. How old are your friends?
- Same age as me.

15:49.932 --> 15:52.025
- How old are you?
- Fourteen.

15:52.468 --> 15:54.561
Hmm, horrible age.

15:56.171 --> 15:57.661
All right, first of all...

15:57.840 --> 16:00.866
...whenever 14-year-old boys talk
about sex, they're lying.

16:01.043 --> 16:04.672
But for a guy like you,
the truth can be a powerful tool.

16:08.083 --> 16:10.950
- What?
- Powerful tool.

16:12.388 --> 16:13.412
Stay with me, Jake.

16:13.589 --> 16:16.149
How about a powerful tool in Bangkok?

16:17.226 --> 16:21.356
Jake, what I'm trying to tell you here
is that the truth can work for you.

16:21.530 --> 16:23.225
That I don't know what I'm doing?

16:23.399 --> 16:27.267
Yep, play to your strengths.
Which in your case is ignorance.

16:28.771 --> 16:31.035
Here, I'll show you.

16:33.575 --> 16:38.376
You gently cup her face in your hands,
look her in the eye and tell her:

16:38.547 --> 16:42.415
"I'm new at this and I'm trusting you
to be patient with me."

16:42.584 --> 16:44.108
You're kidding.

16:44.853 --> 16:48.220
Nope. Girls eat that crap up.

16:48.524 --> 16:52.893
And I'll tell you something else, that line
will work for you all through college.

16:53.062 --> 16:55.326
Or in your case,
your second hitch in the Navy.

16:57.399 --> 16:59.594
Go get dressed
and I'll take you to that party.

17:01.103 --> 17:03.628
- Thanks, Uncle Charlie.
- No problem, buddy.

17:03.806 --> 17:06.434
Still didn't need to hear
that Bangkok story.

17:06.608 --> 17:07.700
I'm sorry.

17:07.876 --> 17:10.071
It's gonna give me nightmares.

17:11.447 --> 17:13.608
Welcome to the club.

17:16.952 --> 17:20.615
All right, we're agreed on a Montessori
preschool, but what about child care?

17:21.056 --> 17:24.253
Oh, well, uh, Judith's mother has told us
we can count on her for babysitting.

17:25.127 --> 17:26.151
Ooh.

17:26.895 --> 17:29.796
- What?
- Oh, nothing. Lenore is a lovely woman.

17:29.965 --> 17:33.457
- I'm sure the baby will be fine.
- Oh, okay, good.

17:33.635 --> 17:37.002
Yeah, she's probably got a lid
on those demons by now.

17:38.073 --> 17:41.304
- What demons?
- Oh, ah, well, it's no biggie.

17:41.477 --> 17:44.935
Um, she just, uh, had a little rough patch
with the prescription pills.

17:46.215 --> 17:48.547
The intervention, the rehab.

17:50.018 --> 17:53.545
- There was an intervention?
- And rehab. Um, three times.

17:55.157 --> 17:58.183
- Three times?
- Well, so far. Um...

17:58.794 --> 18:00.659
Oh, dear God, what the hell happened?

18:02.364 --> 18:04.628
Golly, I didn't wanna be the one
to tell you.

18:05.467 --> 18:06.832
Alan, please.

18:08.203 --> 18:09.830
All right. Um...

18:10.606 --> 18:14.599
Lenore was babysitting one night,
and when Judith and I came home...

18:14.777 --> 18:18.907
...we found her face down in a bowl
of H墧en-Dazs with Percocets in her hair.

18:19.414 --> 18:22.383
- You're kidding.
- Oh, that's not the scary part.

18:22.551 --> 18:26.954
Um, we heard some shrieking
and, uh, found baby Jake...

18:27.122 --> 18:30.956
...with his head stuck in a doggie door
trying to fend off a raccoon.

18:31.126 --> 18:33.526
- A raccoon?
- Yeah. Yeah.

18:33.695 --> 18:35.754
We got him all the shots, uh,
just to be safe...

18:35.931 --> 18:38.525
...but he was never the same after that.

18:39.701 --> 18:42.898
- Judith never told me about this.
- Well, it's her mother, Herb.

18:43.071 --> 18:44.436
I mean, what's she gonna say?

18:44.840 --> 18:46.865
But tell you what,
sneak up on Jake one night...

18:47.042 --> 18:49.169
...wearing a Davy Crockett hat
and see what happens.

18:50.412 --> 18:54.246
Anyway, uh, if you ever need a sitter
for little Jolene...

18:54.416 --> 18:56.611
...you, uh, you call Uncle Alan.

18:56.785 --> 18:59.720
- How's it going in here?
- Oh, honey. Good news.

18:59.888 --> 19:03.449
Alan's offered to babysit
so we don't have risk calling your mother.

19:04.493 --> 19:07.257
JUDITH:
Get out!

19:07.663 --> 19:10.359
A raccoon? And you believed him?

19:10.532 --> 19:12.864
Are you insane?

19:19.341 --> 19:20.433
How do I look?

19:22.077 --> 19:24.136
- She already likes you, right?
- Yeah.

19:25.013 --> 19:26.139
Then you look great.

19:29.484 --> 19:31.076
Let's go.

19:34.189 --> 19:35.850
- Hello?
- Oh.

19:40.429 --> 19:42.329
I'm still not real sure about this.

19:43.131 --> 19:45.599
What's the big deal?
I told you how to handle it.

19:46.335 --> 19:48.826
I know. I just-

19:49.004 --> 19:50.972
I just don't wanna go.

19:52.507 --> 19:53.804
All right.

19:53.976 --> 19:55.375
All right.

19:55.744 --> 19:56.768
No hurry.

19:56.945 --> 19:59.812
It's not like they're gonna stop
making girls.

20:04.119 --> 20:05.609
Hey.

20:06.221 --> 20:08.451
How about we order that pizza
and watch a movie?

20:08.624 --> 20:11.286
Cool. I should probably change back
into my eating shirt.

20:12.694 --> 20:14.628
Don't worry. You can't ruin this shirt.

20:17.332 --> 20:18.765
What the hell is that cologne?

20:18.934 --> 20:21.266
Air freshener from the toilet.

20:23.639 --> 20:26.472
I figured I was spraying it anyway.

20:40.589 --> 20:43.581
Oh, hey, Judith. What's up?

20:43.759 --> 20:45.556
Actually, quite a bit.

20:46.128 --> 20:49.996
- Is something wrong?
- No, uh, it's just, um...

20:50.232 --> 20:53.793
- I think it's time you knew the truth.
- What truth?

20:54.236 --> 20:56.932
Marlene Melnick is your daughter.

20:59.074 --> 21:00.632
I knew it.

21:01.109 --> 21:03.134
For 14 years, I've known it.

21:03.312 --> 21:07.180
Well, I told her everything
and she wants to live with her real dad.

21:08.483 --> 21:09.745
That's great.

21:10.218 --> 21:13.051
It's okay, honey. Come on in.

21:13.455 --> 21:15.184
Hi, Daddy.

21:23.699 --> 21:24.791
You got anything to eat?

21:31.873 --> 21:33.067
Woof.
